Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Main,0,0,0,,---- Main ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:06.02,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,莉莉！ 已經早上了喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.97,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.38,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥 要遲到了喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:41.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.53,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.53,0:00:45.13,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,早安 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:46.90,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,早餐準備好了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:48.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.75,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:01.83,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哈啊… 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:05.06,Text,Renji's Mom,0,0,0,,早安 快點吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.83,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,早安 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:14.47,Text,Renji & Aoi,0,0,0,,- 我開動了\N- 我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:20.10,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,話說回來 莉莉 那個不是快到了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:21.86,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,對啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:25.12,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,妳邀請朋友了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:26.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯 他們說會來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.99,0:01:31.41,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,太好了！ 我也得努力準備招待大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:33.75,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,呵呵 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:42.35,Text,Lily,961,1,0,,好鹹！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:42.35,Text-English,Lily,961,1,0,,How salty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:43.50,Text,Renji,1,961,0,,好酸！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:31.02,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,總覺得不太對 應該有更好的表達方式…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:35.21,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳還醒著嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:38.83,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我不是說過進來前要敲門嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:39.49,Top,Sheryl,0,0,0,,哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.39,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,但我敲門了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:43.24,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:46.80,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,妳一定是專心到沒聽見吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:49.37,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,嗯？ 那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:50.43,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:54.49,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,哦 難不成妳在寫那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:57.43,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好了啦 快點出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.85,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 知道了 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:11.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我很明顯感覺到她在看我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:15.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不過為什麼要躲起來啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:21.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她… 她分明在躲我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:27.02,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我又做了什麼惹她生氣的事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:42.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,結果莉莉之後還是沒出現
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:47.54,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 啊 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.36,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.49,0:04:54.92,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這個 希望你能讀一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:58.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:17.46,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,致草壁蓮司先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:23.45,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,6月24日會在我家舉辦我的生日派對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:27.57,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,葵衣 師父 還有學校的朋友都會來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:30.65,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,如果不介意的話 不知您是否方便參加？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.86,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,生日…！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:36.45,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,難不成今天妳坐立不安就是因為這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:37.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:40.64,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,呃… 嗯… 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:43.78,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:46.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我還以為是我做錯了什麼
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.61,0:05:51.82,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉已經會寫這麼多日文了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:54.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,總覺得有點感動呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:58.48,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,所以 蓮司 你會來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:00.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我當然會去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:02.04,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.67,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我們約定好了喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.67,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,That's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:11.22,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,一定一定喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:12.58,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:27.54,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,仔細想想 這場生日派對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.25,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不就除了我以外全都是國中女生嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:34.48,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,而且還要跟她那個爸爸待在一起？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:38.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒… 沒問題吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:52.54,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,現在開始為了莉莉同學生日派對的作戰會議
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.30,Text,Glasses-chan & Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,- 耶\N- 耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.93,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,生日派對還真是令人期待呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:00.81,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,真是的 為什麼連我都要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.94,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是莉莉的生日派對耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.18,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳會參加的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:05.80,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那倒是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.56,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,那該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:11.19,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,禮物還是希望大家送不一樣的比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.37,0:07:16.08,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這樣的話 我們最好現在就決定要送什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:20.36,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,莉莉有很多男子漢無尾熊的周邊商品吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:23.08,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,如果送了她已經有的東西就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:27.48,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那樣的話 最好還是避免送男子漢無尾熊的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:28.59,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:33.10,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那該送什麼好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:36.85,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,各自送自己想送的不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:40.23,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,加賀同學已經決定好禮物了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.13,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,遊戲相關的東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:44.72,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳還真是不動搖呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:47.68,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,不過就是要這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:52.24,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,嗯 我覺得重要的不是禮物本身 而是心意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.37,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,說得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:56.15,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,真不愧是加賀同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:01.70,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那麼 我要送莉莉同學她會喜歡的文具
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那我或許送美容用品之類的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:07.14,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,我… 我們也得快點決定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:10.83,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,嗯 不一樣的東西 不一樣的東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:12.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,大家在做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.63,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:16.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.01,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:22.02,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,啊！ 休息時間快結束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:25.17,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,不知為何 我突然好想上課喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:27.15,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,數… 數學課好令人期待喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:29.53,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳們這些人真的很不會裝耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:38.44,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,祝妳生日快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:42.88,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,祝妳生日快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:49.22,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,祝親愛的莉莉生日快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:56.05,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,祝妳生日快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.42,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,好了 各位 準備囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:00.93,Comment,Sheryl,0,0,0,,※  翻譯來源：劍橋詞典
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:08:59.43,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:08:59.43,Text-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Hip hip!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:00.93,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,萬歲！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:00.93,Text-English,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.93,0:09:03.08,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.08,Top,Sheryl,0,0,0,,嗚呼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.47,0:09:05.05,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,在此為您說明！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.05,0:09:09.37,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,在英國 唱完生日快樂歌後 會像這樣歡呼慶祝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.95,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:18.66,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哎呀 能和莉莉關係變得這麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.96,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,還能一起慶祝生日 真是太開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.46,Text,Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,- 對啊！\N- 對啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:28.96,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,大家一直以來都和莉莉這麼要好 真的很謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:31.33,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,因為她是我們很重要的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.51,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,生日真的有那麼值得慶祝嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:35.96,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,只是老了一歲而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:39.72,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳又在說這種彆扭的話了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:44.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,吃點美味的料理冷靜一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:45.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,來 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:47.59,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝 蓮！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:51.74,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,蓮司先生和莉莉到底是什麼關係啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:53.36,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,我… 我不知道…？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:56.61,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,我只聽說他們關係很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:58.66,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮也要好好吃喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.70,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.29,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不過蛋糕我想留到最後吃…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:06.82,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,來 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:07.79,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.48,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,豈止是關係好 根本在打情罵俏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:15.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,要是莉莉的爸爸看到這一幕…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:19.14,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,「啊」個屁啊 你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.68,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,連我都沒有被她餵過啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:28.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,肯定會一發不可收拾！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,話… 話說回來 妳爸爸今天呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:34.94,High,Lily,0,0,0,,在工作喔！ 我們家明天會辦自己的生日派對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:34.94,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,At work! We'll have a family party tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:37.07,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,原… 原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.99,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:40.39,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:45.15,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,竟然聽得懂英文 蓮司先生好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.49,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮很厲害對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:53.46,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,為什麼莉莉一臉得意啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.46,0:10:56.62,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,他們到底是什麼關係啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:14.81,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,謝謝您這麼盛情的招待
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:16.82,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真的非常好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:20.08,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,沒關係 畢竟是莉莉的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:21.06,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,大家多吃點喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:22.05,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.63,0:11:23.81,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:25.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:29.45,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不過莉莉 妳不用全部都餵我吃啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:30.95,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:33.05,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,莉莉看起來興致很高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:49.58,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,謝謝招待！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.25,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.40,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳現在就要先開始準備了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.40,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Lily, you should get ready now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.22,High,Lily,0,0,0,,對耶 好像是耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.22,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:11:59.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:04.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我突然想到有事要做 我馬上回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:06.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦 明明是妳自己的生日耶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:12.08,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那你們就隨意玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:14.91,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,大家就當自己家一樣喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:16.00,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:18.53,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:21.00,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,她們看起來很著急
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.98,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那來打電動吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:24.51,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,竟然準備得這麼齊全！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:34.16,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,小哥 今天就是我終於要跟你一決勝負的時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:36.78,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,但今天可是慶祝的場合耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:39.69,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那就順便慶祝我的勝利不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:41.52,Text,Aoi & Renji,0,0,0,,- 又在胡說八道了\N- 又在胡說八道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.28,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,難得有這個機會 大家一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.36,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,而且控制器也夠我們所有人用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.53,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,不… 不知道我玩不玩得好…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:54.55,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,哼 沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:57.24,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,你們全部一起上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.26,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Game set
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:04.43,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,可惡！ 又是第二名！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:06.29,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,為什麼我就是贏不了小哥啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:09.37,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我… 我們一次都沒贏過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:14.10,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,喂 你也對她們手下留情點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:15.81,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,抱… 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:18.59,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,再來一場！ 再來一場！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:21.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好… 好啦 讓我休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.37,0:13:22.56,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,你可不准落跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:25.32,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,蓮司先生好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:26.94,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,他該不會是職業選手吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:29.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒有啦 沒那麼厲害…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:32.19,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,對吧！ 蓮超厲害的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:34.21,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？ 是莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:13:59.31,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,噹噹！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:00.02,Text,Renji & Aoi,0,0,0,,- 咦？\N- 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:01.52,Text,Glasses-chan & Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,- 好可愛\N- 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:03.77,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,非常漂亮喔 莉莉同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:04.85,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:09.11,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,哎呀 嚇到各位朋友了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:11.54,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,在英國的生日派對上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:15.39,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,有時也會像日本的 Cosplay 一樣打扮來慶祝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:20.50,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我想讓大家體驗看看道地的英式生日派對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:23.76,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 所以才扮成「愛麗絲夢遊仙境」啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.34,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,什麼叫「哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,給我好好稱讚人家啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:28.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:33.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個 妳看起來比平常更可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:36.09,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,簡直就像真正的愛麗絲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:39.44,High,Lily,0,0,0,,太誇張了啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:39.44,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,That's too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:42.00,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 抱… 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:44.97,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥 你太誇張了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:49.49,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:52.49,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,難得有這個機會 不如大家也來 Cosplay 吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:53.89,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:57.37,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,大家都好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:01.77,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,還好這些派對服裝我都還留著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:09.16,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,「我要讓你迷路！」開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:11.59,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這是… 白兔嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:13.50,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,很適合妳啊 班長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.38,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真… 真的嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:20.97,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,我好像是第一次 Cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.97,0:15:23.89,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,有… 有點害羞 但很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:26.98,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,為什麼連我都…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:29.83,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,很適合妳喔 加賀同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.52,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,至少不是那種有很多荷葉邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:35.53,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,大家都好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:40.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,只有我不太一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:43.04,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮 很適合喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:47.91,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,「愛麗絲夢遊仙境」的角色差不多都湊齊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:50.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,裡面真的有無尾熊嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:51.92,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,怎麼可能會有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:16:01.69,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不… 不過 至少莉莉看起來很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:04.93,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,各位 來拍照囉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:15.21,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉 我們有東西要送妳喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:16.41,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:18.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個 我也有…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.86,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥你最後！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:20.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:22.82,Text,Girls,0,0,0,,噹噹！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.21,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:29.96,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我們各自帶了我們覺得莉莉會喜歡的禮物！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.34,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,太好了 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.27,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:35.71,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我可以打開嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:37.09,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:48.14,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哦！ 是街機搖桿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:50.36,Comment,Lily,0,0,0,,※ {\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}アケコン{\r}：{\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}アーケードコントローラー{\r}（Arcade Controller）的縮寫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:50.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝 師父！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:53.49,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳就用那個多練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.36,High,Lily,0,0,0,,文具耶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.36,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Stationery?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:57.86,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.23,0:17:01.06,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那是我送的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:05.49,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我想說如果妳能邊開心使用邊學習日本的事物就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:09.74,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,可愛到我捨不得用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.25,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,請務必使用它！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 螢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.63,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,螢…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:19.14,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,莉… 莉莉同學叫了我的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.41,High,Lily,0,0,0,,喔 護唇膏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.41,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh! Lip balm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哦 那個是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:28.64,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,原來護唇膏的英文是這樣說的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:31.16,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,包裝好可愛 謝謝 葵衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.65,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝 葵衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.78,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不客氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:37.79,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這邊的好大喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:38.70,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:40.54,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,那些是我們送的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.43,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,是什麼呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.53,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:47.09,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,我實在不知道該送妳什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:49.79,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,所以就選了日本的傳統食物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:53.67,Comment,,0,0,0,,※ 酸梅乾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:53.25,High,Lily,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃！ 像水果一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:53.25,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Looks delicious! Like a fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:55.29,Text,Aoi & Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:59.56,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,太好了！ 幸好妳喜歡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:01.21,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這個是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:05.01,Comment,Lily,0,0,0,,※ 馬麥醬 Marmite：英國傳統食品 使用啤酒糟製成的酵母萃取物醬料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:05.01,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哦！ 馬麥醬…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:08.97,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,我從來沒送過禮物給外國朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:11.20,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,所以我也想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:14.44,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,我想說妳熟悉的食物或許會比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:17.32,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝！ 我很開心！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:19.95,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,太… 太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.50,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:24.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那換我送妳生日禮物了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:25.32,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:40.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是條手帕 希望妳會喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.64,High,Lily,0,0,0,,遊樂場限定的耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.64,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,The one limited to amusement arcades!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:47.47,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哇！ 真不愧是妳！ 馬上就認出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:53.02,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我會好好珍惜的 謝謝你 蓮！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:53.02,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll always take good care of it! Thanks, Renji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.47,0:18:57.59,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,竟然不擔心會重複 還送男子漢無尾熊的周邊商品…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:19:00.68,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,難道他掌握了莉莉所有擁有的物品嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:04.23,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,蓮司先生跟她到底是什麼關係…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:20.87,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她爸爸不在 我們卻玩得這麼開心 總覺得有點過意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:22.35,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,沒關係 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:26.39,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,有他在的話 他會太興奮 反而沒辦法收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:31.25,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,他今年也為了她的生日準備了服裝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:32.43,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,服裝？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:34.14,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:36.28,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:41.78,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,呃 我好像跟爸爸說錯我們家人派對的日期了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:48.12,High,Oliver,0,0,0,,嘿！ 爸爸提早下班回家了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:48.12,High-English,Oliver,0,0,0,,Hey! Daddy finished work early and came home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:58.33,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,抱歉 我晚點再來…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:02.27,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你為什麼會在這裡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.27,0:20:03.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:05.39,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,而且還穿得跟我一樣！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:08.40,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,不過 我的無尾熊更高貴更美麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:10.26,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,對吧 莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:12.50,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮 來 笑一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:22.80,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你這傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:07.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,媽媽 我想吃禮物收到的那個紅色的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:08.72,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:11.37,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,是這個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.11,0:21:33.51,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 那不就是莉莉收到的東西嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:38.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對啊 我前陣子看到 覺得很好奇就買來試試
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.11,Text,Renji,1,961,0,,好鹹！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:46.90,Text,Lily,961,1,0,,好酸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:46.90,Text-English,Lily,961,1,0,,How sour!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:52.74,Text,Lily,961,1,0,,為什麼會吃這種東西啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:52.74,Text,Renji,1,961,0,,為什麼會吃這種東西啊？
