Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.47,0:22:07.18,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！ つかめ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:08.97,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ パワー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:11.56,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:14.35,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Fight！ Fight！ Fight！ 欲張れ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.35,0:22:15.48,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Beat Down！ Down！ Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:18.65,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,いざEn-Joy！ Joy！ Joy！ Let's Get Over！
