Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:28.33,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,What a fresh experience！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:31.29,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,いつの間にかみんなで
