Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.17,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,ハマったり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:46.18,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,ボコボコにやられてへこんだりと
Comment: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:52.77,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}作る思い出　賑わうこの{\k0}空間|<ばしょ{\k0}で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:52.77,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,作る思い出　賑わうこの空間で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:56.44,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,たまには Like a superhero に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:23:02.61,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,誰でもなれるかもしれない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:05.61,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we enjoy them！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.61,0:23:07.41,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we love it all！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:10.87,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,日々更新される楽しさの理論値
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.87,0:23:12.70,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,So here's the wonderland！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.33,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:18.25,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,失敗してもう一回　次も一緒にね
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:20.13,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！ つかめ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.13,0:23:21.84,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ パワー
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:24.38,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:25.34,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,(Oh my gosh！)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:28.35,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Uh！ Oh！ Oh！ もう It's Time Up！ Up！ Up！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:33.68,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,それじゃまた明日もここで　See you again！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.47,0:22:07.18,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！  把握機會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:08.97,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ 充滿力量
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:11.56,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:14.35,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Fight！ Fight！ Fight！ 不要吝嗇慾望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.35,0:22:15.48,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Beat Down！ Down！ Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:18.65,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,來吧 En-Joy！ Joy！ Joy！ Let's Get Over！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:22.49,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,投下代幣的那一瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:26.12,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,展開嶄新世界 interaction
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:28.33,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,What a fresh experience！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:31.29,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,不知不覺間大家也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:33.42,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,享受其中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:36.79,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,熱血沸騰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.17,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,上癮不已
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:46.18,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,被虐得體無完膚 意志消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:52.77,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,但也一起創造回憶 在這熱鬧的空間中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:56.44,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,偶爾 Like a superhero
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:23:02.61,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,說不定任何人都有機會成為主角
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:05.61,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we enjoy them！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.61,0:23:07.41,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we love it all！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:10.87,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,每天都在更新的樂趣理論值
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.87,0:23:12.70,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,So here's the wonderland！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.33,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:18.25,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,即使失敗再一次 下次也一起挑戰吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:20.13,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！ 抓住它
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.13,0:23:21.84,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ 是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:24.38,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:25.34,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,（Oh my gosh！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:28.35,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Uh！ Oh！ Oh！ 已經 It's Time Up！ Up！ Up！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:33.68,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,那麼明天再來這裡見吧 See you again！
